					<img decoding="async" fetchpriority="high" class="e-image-base e-default-img" data-interaction-id="ba8967f" data-e-type="widget" data-id="ba8967f" id="100768" src="/wp-content/uploads/Stainless-Steel-Mesh-Water-Wall-at-Four-Points-by-Sheraton-at-Miami-Airport-2-jpg.avif" width="1608" height="1077" srcset="/wp-content/uploads/Stainless-Steel-Mesh-Water-Wall-at-Four-Points-by-Sheraton-at-Miami-Airport-2-jpg-100x100.avif 100w, /wp-content/uploads/Stainless-Steel-Mesh-Water-Wall-at-Four-Points-by-Sheraton-at-Miami-Airport-2-jpg-768x514.avif 768w, /wp-content/uploads/Stainless-Steel-Mesh-Water-Wall-at-Four-Points-by-Sheraton-at-Miami-Airport-2-jpg-800x536.avif 800w, /wp-content/uploads/Stainless-Steel-Mesh-Water-Wall-at-Four-Points-by-Sheraton-at-Miami-Airport-2-jpg-1440x964.avif 1440w, /wp-content/uploads/Stainless-Steel-Mesh-Water-Wall-at-Four-Points-by-Sheraton-at-Miami-Airport-2-jpg.avif 1608w" alt="Stainless Steel Mesh Water Wall at Four Points by Sheraton at Miami Airport" title="Airports 2" sizes="(max-width: 1608px) 100vw, 1608px" data-mtfi="1">				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-84a2ceb elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="84a2ceb" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<h2><strong>Water Features That Work in Airports</strong></h2><p>Every airport has different needs. Some want something that draws attention. Others want something calm in a high-traffic area. We build water features that fit both goals and everything in between.</p><p>Here are a few types that work well in airports:</p><ul><li><strong>Bubble Walls</strong> – great near entrances or walkways</li><li><strong>Indoor Waterfalls</strong> – works in open spaces with higher ceilings</li><li><strong>Water Walls</strong> – easy to care for and safe around travelers</li><li><strong>Rain Curtains</strong> – ideal for dividing spaces without blocking light</li><li><strong>Reflection Pools</strong> – adds elegance near lounges or rest areas</li></ul><p>Each feature is built in our Illinois facility by trained craftspeople. We also handle full installation across the U.S. and Canada.</p><p> </p>								</div>
					</div>
				</div>
				<section class="elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-42e02cb2 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default" data-id="42e02cb2" data-element_type="section" data-e-type="section">
